| `traceability.matrix_schema` | string | `config/traceability/matrix.schema.json` | a repo-relative path to a JSON Schema with a `schema_version.const` and a `maxLength` on `$defs.cited_id` and `$defs.reason` | `scripts/traceability.py` (`read_bounds`); `scripts/trace_requirements.py` | Names the schema the matrix cites and takes its version and length caps from; an unreadable one is refused with exit 2 and removes the earlier matrix. | the version itself, which only the schema file states | always |
